Item\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A single line item in the invoice detail section.\\\" .\\n\\n:ReferenceNumber a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Reference Number\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A reference number for the invoice or items.\\\" .\\n\\n:BusinessProcess a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Business Process\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A business process to which the invoice can be assigned.\\\" .\\n\\n:Standard a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Standard\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A standard with which the invoice is aligned, e.g. EN 16931-1 or P2P-O.\\\" .\\n\\n:EN16931_1 a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:subClassOf :Standard ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"EN 16931-1\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The European Standard EN 16931-1 for electronic invoicing.\\\" .\\n\\n:P2P_Ontology a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:subClassOf :Standard ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Purchase-to-Pay Ontology\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The Purchase-to-Pay Ontology (P2P-O) for items, prices, and organizations.\\\" .\\n\\n:EDIFACTDirectory a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:subClassOf :Standard ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"EDIFACT Directory\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The directory specifying mandatory identifiers and elements for EDIFACT.\\\" .\\n\\n:SHACLConstraint a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"SHACL Constraint\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A SHACL constraint for validation of invoice data.\\\" .\\n\\n:RoleAssignment a owl:Class ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"Role Assignment\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"A reification class linking Organization, AgentRole, and Invoice context.\\\" .\\n\\n#################################################################\\n# Object Properties\\n#################################################################\\n:containsMessage a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InterchangeEnvelope ;\\n    rdfs:range :EDIFACTMessage ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"contains message\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InterchangeEnvelope to the EDIFACTMessage it contains.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasSegment a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :EDIFACTMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :Segment ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has segment\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an EDIFACTMessage to its segments.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasCompositeElement a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Segment ;\\n    rdfs:range :CompositeDataElement ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has composite element\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a Segment to its CompositeDataElements.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasSimpleElement a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :CompositeDataElement ;\\n    rdfs:range :SimpleDataElement ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has simple element\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a CompositeDataElement to its SimpleDataElements.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasDelimiter a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :EDIFACTMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :Delimiter ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has delimiter\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an EDIFACTMessage to a delimiter used in its structure.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasSection a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range rdf:Resource ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has section\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceMessage to one of its sections (header, detail, summary).\\\" .\\n\\n:hasHeaderSection a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :InvoiceHeaderSection ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has header section\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceMessage to its header section.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasDetailSection a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :InvoiceDetailSection ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has detail section\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceMessage to its detail section.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasSummarySection a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :InvoiceSummarySection ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has summary section\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceMessage to its summary section.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasLineItem a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceDetailSection ;\\n    rdfs:range :LineItem ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has line item\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceDetailSection to its LineItems.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasOrganization a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :Organization ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has organization\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceMessage to an involved Organization.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasRoleAssignment a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :RoleAssignment ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has role assignment\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceMessage to a RoleAssignment (Organization+Role context).\\\" .\\n\\n:involvesOrganization a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :RoleAssignment ;\\n    rdfs:range :Organization ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"involves organization\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a RoleAssignment to the Organization involved.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasAgentRole a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :RoleAssignment ;\\n    rdfs:range :AgentRole ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has agent role\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a RoleAssignment to the AgentRole played by the Organization.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasAddress a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Organization ;\\n    rdfs:range :Address ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has address\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an Organization to its Address.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasIdentifier a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Organization ;\\n    rdfs:range :Identifier ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has identifier\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an Organization to its Identifier(s).\\\" .\\n\\n:hasGlobalLocationNumber a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Organization ;\\n    rdfs:range :GlobalLocationNumber ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has global location number\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an Organization to its Global Location Number (GLN).\\\" .\\n\\n:playsRoleIn a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Organization ;\\n    rdfs:range :RoleAssignment ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"plays role in\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an Organization to the RoleAssignment(s) it participates in.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasItem a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :LineItem ;\\n    rdfs:range :Item ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has item\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a LineItem to the Item being sold.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasNetPrice a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :LineItem ;\\n    rdfs:range :Price ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has net price\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a LineItem to its net Price.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasQuantity a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :LineItem ;\\n    rdfs:range :Quantity ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has quantity\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a LineItem to its Quantity.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasTax a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceSummarySection ;\\n    rdfs:range :Tax ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has tax\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceSummarySection to its Tax details.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasBusinessProcess a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :BusinessProcess ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has business process\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates an InvoiceMessage to its business process context.\\\" .\\n\\n:isAlignedWithStandard a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :Standard ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"is aligned with standard\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Indicates the standard(s) with which the InvoiceMessage is aligned.\\\" .\\n\\n:validatedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\\n    rdfs:range :SHACLConstraint ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"validated by\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Indicates the SHACL constraint(s) used to validate the invoice.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasMandatoryIdentifier a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :EDIFACTDirectory ;\\n    rdfs:range :Identifier ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has mandatory identifier\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Specifies mandatory identifiers required by the EDIFACT directory.\\\" .\\n\\n#################################################################\\n# Data Properties\\n#################################################################\\n:hasReferenceNumber a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceHeaderSection ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has reference number\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The reference number in the invoice header.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasInvoiceNumber a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceHeaderSection ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has invoice number\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The invoice number in the invoice header.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasDate a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceHeaderSection ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has date\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The date in the invoice header (format as per standard).\\\" .\\n\\n:hasInvoiceAmount a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceSummarySection ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has invoice amount\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The total invoice amount in the summary section.\\\" .\\n\\n:hasTotalTaxAmount a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceSummarySection ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"has total tax amount\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The total tax amount in the summary section.\\\" .\\n\\n#################################################################\\n# Advanced Axioms, Restrictions, and Characteristics\\n#################################################################\\n# Example: All organizations must have at least one identifier\\n:Organization rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasIdentifier ; owl:someValuesFrom :Identifier ] .\\n\\n# RoleAssignment is defined as an Organization with a Role in an Invoice context\\n:RoleAssignment owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ; owl:intersectionOf (\\n    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :involvesOrganization ; owl:someValuesFrom :Organization ]\\n    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasAgentRole ; owl:someValuesFrom :AgentRole ]\\n) ] .\\n\\n# InvoiceMessage must have header, detail, and summary sections (functional)\\n:InvoiceMessage rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasHeaderSection ; owl:someValuesFrom :InvoiceHeaderSection ] ,\\n    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasDetailSection ; owl:someValuesFrom :InvoiceDetailSection ] ,\\n    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasSummarySection ; owl:someValuesFrom :InvoiceSummarySection ] .\\n\\n# InvoiceDetailSection must have at least one LineItem\\n:InvoiceDetailSection rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasLineItem ; owl:someValuesFrom :LineItem ] .\\n\\n# LineItem must have Item, Quantity, and NetPrice\\n:LineItem rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasItem ; owl:someValuesFrom :Item ] ,\\n    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasQuantity ; owl:someValuesFrom :Quantity ] ,\\n    [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasNetPrice ; owl:someValuesFrom :Price ] .\\n\\n# Disjointness axioms\\n:Organization owl:disjointWith :Item , :AgentRole , :LineItem .\\n:InvoiceHeaderSection owl:disjointWith :InvoiceDetailSection , :InvoiceSummarySection .\\n:InvoiceDetailSection owl:disjointWith :InvoiceSummarySection .\\n\\n# Property characteristics\\n:hasAddress a owl:FunctionalProperty .\\n:hasGlobalLocationNumber a owl:FunctionalProperty .\\n:hasHeaderSection a owl:FunctionalProperty .\\n:hasDetailSection a owl:FunctionalProperty .\\n:hasSummarySection a owl:FunctionalProperty .\\n:containsMessage a owl:FunctionalProperty .\\n\"}",
